                Fact = "Gravity is the pull that anything with mass has on everything else. Earth is so massive that its pull keeps your feet on the ground, holds the Moon in orbit, and keeps Earth circling the Sun. The more massive something is, the stronger it pulls." },
            new() { Topic = "Why planets are round",
