                Fact = "Fossil footprints are snapshots of dinosaurs actually moving. From a trackway's stride length scientists can calculate the animal's speed, tell if it walked or ran, and even spot herds travelling together with babies protected in the middle." },
            new() { Topic = "Dinosaur poop",
