                Fact = "Sue is the most complete T. Rex skeleton ever found — about 90 percent of the bones, discovered in 1990 by fossil hunter Sue Hendrickson. Sue now stands in the Field Museum in Chicago, 12.3 metres of the most studied dinosaur on Earth." },
