                Fact = "In one real way, yes — birds ARE living dinosaurs, descended from small feathered meat-eaters. So the pigeon at the park is a distant cousin of Velociraptor. But the giant dinosaurs like T. Rex are gone forever; no hidden ones survive anywhere on Earth." },
